## Computing DR

D = (−7/2, 0), R = (1127/578, 840/289):

$$DR^2 = \left(\frac{1127}{578} + \frac{7}{2}\right)^2 + \left(\frac{840}{289}\right)^2 = \left(\frac{1575}{289}\right)^2 + \left(\frac{840}{289}\right)^2 = \frac{1575^2 + 840^2}{289^2}$$

